            "review_title": "Review at Sapa Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "RASHIDA HUSAIN\nSingapore, Singapore492 contributions\n1\nTruly Halal Certified Restaurant.\nSep 2025 • Couples\nFirstly we were truly appreciative for having a Safe Halal Restaurant in Sapa. most places we went were halal friendly which combined with other non halal food and we were skeptical. But this place was Halal certified and completely safe. We loved their Pho and all dishes cooked to perfection as per our needs.\ntheir Lady Boss was very friendly and accomodating to our dietary requirements. Every dish tasted Yummy. thank you once again.\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
