            "review_title": "Review at Sapa Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Masela Fadjar Pratiwi\nSemarang, Indonesia349 contributions\n0\nBest halal restaurant in Sapa\nJan 2025 • Friends\nAs a Muslim, finding a halal restaurant in Sapa can be challenging, but Sapa Halal Restaurant was a great find! 🍽️✨ We ate here during our stay, and the food was delicious with a variety of menu options. The interior is nice and cozy, making it a comfortable place to dine. The prices are a bit on the higher side, but considering the difficulty of finding halal food in the area, it's worth it. Definitely a good option for Muslim travelers visiting Sapa! 🇻🇳\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2025",
